	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=3000, wait=1500, sync=1},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040050"},
		line=1177,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"As we head back to the Imperial Palace, Himi-no-Mikoto says she wishes to survey the state of Tenkyo, and so we make our way down the high street.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"As soon as they notice our presence, the townspeople immediately prostrate themselves on the side of the road.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"They even have the propriety to show their respect without blocking our way.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Their bowed heads and overawed expressions express their reverence for Himi-no-Mikoto, said to be the incarnation of the sun itself.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My faithful people, do you find yourselves well?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Know that no matter your status, should you have any grievances, you may make them heard at the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"At Himi-no-Mikoto's benevolent proclamation, the faces of the citizenry light up with hopeful smiles.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Never forget that it is the people who form the very foundation of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It is they whom we must protect before all else.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"She whispers this in mine ear as she waves to the assembled crowds.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The Empire is nothing without its people─ this is\nHimi-no-Mikoto's favorite saying.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I have heard it countless times, and I remember it well.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"After proceeding for a while longer, we encounter a large crowd of onlookers.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, what lies over yon?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The Capital Watch guardhouse.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Oh, there's Tooru.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Tooru notices us as we approach closer.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama. What an honor it is to be so unexpectedly graced by your presence.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Tooru kneels and bows his head.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“No need. 'Twas nothing but a flight of whimsy.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What warrants this commotion?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“We are presently preparing to execute a criminal who has terrorized Tenkyo as of late.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"I look and spot a man tightly bound in crude ropes kneeling at the center of the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That man...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Know you of him?”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He is the criminal who cut me on mine back.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ah, I suppose that did happen.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"In short order, a deep drumbeat proclaims the commencement of the execution.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"As the masses watch from afar, Tooru reads aloud the charges.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"─Breaking into a boarding house and massacring all its occupants, hacking several younglings to pieces, and on and on.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Upon hearing this unspeakably horrible account of his crimes, the crowd hurls a stream of abuse at the condemned man.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"All of a sudden, peals of repulsive laughter echo across the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"The criminal at the center of the crowd's jeers throws his head back with uncontrollable laughter as though he's lost his senses.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"This only serves to further inflame the crowd's furor.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Silence! I will have order!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Ahh, seriously...?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Tooru throws his hands up in exasperation.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Naturally, the uproar does not subside in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“So this is the venerable head of House Inou...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Smiling faintly to herself, Himi-no-Mikoto begins parting the crowds.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"As she does, more and more onlookers recognize the visage of their Empress and fall silent.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"With an unhurried grace, she eventually arrives in front of the criminal.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Surcease of your laughter!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The criminal bares his teeth in a horrible grin.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Whos youse s'posed to be?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto. Perhaps you have heard of me?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“So you're... her...”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The criminal stares fixedly at Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“How beautiful... Such beauty...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“...Truly as the sun descended down on the world.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Not just all humanity... Even the grass and the trees and all the wild beasts oughta kneel before you...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Aaaaarrghhh...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Straining against his bonds, the criminal grinds his forehead into the firm earth.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"It seems Himi-no-Mikoto's beauty is capable of charming even the basest of souls.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You have committed many unforgivable sins. Have you anything to say in your defense?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“As if I needs anythin' like that.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“I just do what me heart tells me to.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Youse oughta give it a try sometime!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto merely shuts her eyes in response.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are to atone for your sins with your life. It is the least you could do to redress all those whom you have harmed.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Oh, so ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"thaaat's",
{"/font"},
" it, eh? All these people wants is to have me head?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Why didn'tcha just say so earlier? I ain't so bright,\ny'know...”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Ahahahaha! Sure thing, go aheads and have at it!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The criminal chortles with a wide smile on his face.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"His bright and carefree expression is entirely at odds with the savagery of his crimes.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"...What manner of man is this?",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It seems you are bereft of anything resembling a human heart.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto fixes the criminal with a pair of still eyes.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps you had the misfortune of being scorned by those who begot you, or perhaps hunger or disease have consumed your sanity...”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I know not what grudge compelled you to sin, but your crimes cannot be forgiven.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“However, I shall at least pray that your soul might find a more fortunate existence in the next life.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“...You'll pray for me soul?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto turns her back to the condemned man, offering no further response.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Inou, handle the rest.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Your will be done.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“As Himi-no-Mikoto-sama nobly decrees, so now shall I see her justice done!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"A voice louder than all the others pierces through the din of the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“I'll make y'mine!”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Criminal"},
			{
"“I swear I will! I swear it!”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"The headsman's blade falls─",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"And with it, the criminal's strained outcries are no more, replaced instead by the raucous cheers of the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Next in line.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto flatly declares from her seat of honor.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Her face is a perfect mask of composure, but beneath it, I imagine she is surely in a foul temper.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto has been entertaining prospective suitors since early in the morning.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="One of the Heads"},
			{
"“I am honored to be granted an audience on this fine day.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"The nobleman prostrating himself before her beckons his manservants to carry in a veritable mountain of tribute.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto stands at the pinnacle of the Empire, so anyone wed to her would immediately obtain an enormous amount of influence.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Hence, the men seeking to become her groom are as numerous as the stars above.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="One of the Heads"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, please accept these trifles as a mere token of my feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="One of the Heads"},
			{
"“No treasure in the realm could be too lavish for the likes of you! You need but say the word and I would procure it at once.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Indeed. I shall graciously accept your gifts.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I understand now that your generosity truly has no bounds.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="One of the Heads"},
			{
"“You have my sincere thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Next in line, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="One of the Heads"},
			{
"“...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Even such an abrupt dismissal from Himi-no-Mikoto brooks no objection.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The spurned suitor hastily shuffles out of the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"A kinsman of House Maki is the next in line.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"He boastfully declares himself to be without any peer in the martial arts.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In that case, it should be a simple matter for you to defeat Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kinsman of Maki"},
			{
"“Mrgh...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I proceed to cross blades with the impressively persistent man for quite some time.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Of course, I would never allow myself to be bested by a mere human.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"One suitor after another proceed to make their appeals to Himi-no-Mikoto before being summarily turned away.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"The Imperial storehouses overflow with tribute to the extent that the excess is piled up in the maidservants' quarters.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Haah, how exhausting!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"As soon as her brief period of recess begins, Himi-no-Mikoto flops backwards onto the floor.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is it for the best to turn everyone down so curtly?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“All of them expressed no shortage of passion.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You seriously wish for me to take a groom?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“If it will result in greater stability for the Empire, I believe you should.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“...Really now? Is that really so?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That is to say, you would have no objections were I to become intimate with another man?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You will need to birth an heir sooner or later.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Begone from my sight.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Hmm?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Begone with you!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I've been chased out.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"It would appear that I have caused mine Empress some grave affront.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"...What meaning could there be in insisting that she not lay with another man?",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"To do so would run counter to the best interests of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"How confounding...",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ah, Mitsurugi-sama! Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"As I wander the palace halls, I encounter Tooru and Chihaya.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What are you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Why, is it not apparent?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I wish to bear witness to the outcome of the marriage interviews.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Chihaya-dono and I were just now discussing which of these men had the most merit.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Even you, Tooru?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“C'mon, what's the harm? Everyone's dying to know.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“The priestesses are always in a tizzy speculating about what sorts of gentlemen will attend.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Last time, the arrival of Master Okonogi caused quite the stir!”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I'm amazed he would even try at his age.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“As an aside, Mitsurugi-sama, might you know how the events are proceeding?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Just as always, she turned them all away without a second thought.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hold up. Aren't the interviews still going on?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I was chased out.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto chased me out.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“She no longer wished to see mine face.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, what might you have done to make Himi-no-Mikoto-sama so cross?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hahaha! You said more than you should've, didn'tcha?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I believe I provided nothing but reasonable answers to her questions.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I proceed to recount the details of what happened earlier.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Pfft... Heh, ahahahahaha! St-Stop it, my sides can't take it anymore...”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I say, Tooru, is this truly a laughing matter?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Pfft... That simply will not do, Mitsurugi-sama. You\nmustn't say things like that...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“...I shall pray for you, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Even Chihaya is laughing for some reason.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What need have you for that? I only stated the obvious, did I not?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, that's rich... Mitsurugi, your concern for the Empire's future is nothing short of admirable.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“That's the savior of the realm for you!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What are you insinuating?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I fix Tooru with a cold glare, but he simply shrugs it off.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, could it be that you are truly unaware?”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“All the tittle-tattle in the palace is that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" are the most likely candidate to be her groom!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Me? Surely you jest.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“You're impressively informed for having only moved in a few days ago, Chihaya-dono.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“But of course! There is no maiden alive that does not have a sharp ear for matters of love and intrigue!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Chihaya puffs out her large chest with pride.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“So there you have it, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Now do you finally get what you did to earn\nHimi-no-Mikoto's displeasure?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Not in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh yeah? That's it right there! Never change, buddy!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Tooru sputters as he doubles over with laughter once more.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama is taken with you, Mitsurugi-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“That is why she secretly wishes for you to dispense of all the other men who seek to win her hand.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Could I really do such a thing?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi-sama, could it be that you do not favor Himi-no-Mikoto-sama with your affection?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto is a personage well worthy of mine respect.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But mine relationship with Himi-no-Mikoto will only be that of lord and blade.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Feelings of romance cannot be.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is mine creator.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Despite the boundless trust and respect I have for her, our relationship is not one capable of developing into romance.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hmm? Is that how it is?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Then why do you not schedule an interview yourself?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, come now. I'm a simple nobody, and she is the sun.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I'd like to believe I know my place.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"He brushes me off with a smooth reply, but anyone familiar with Tooru would know just how devoted he is to his wife and child.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"He would never possibly seek to win Himi-no-Mikoto's hand.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Besides, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama would never settle for any ordinary man, would she?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And therein lies the problem.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Don't you go saying that in front of her if you know what's good for you...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Tooru and Chihaya sigh in unison.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Incidentally, do you truly not harbor any romantic affections for women whatsoever?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“That's right.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“D-Does that mean, hypothetically speaking, that one such as me would also not even merit any consideration?”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ah, ah! H-Hypothetically speaking, of course! Purely hypothetically speaking!”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Chihaya desperately makes excuses for herself.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You see, the priestesses around me have taken to calling me 'Mitsurugi-sama's bride' as of late...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hence I was thinking... perhaps such an outcome... might not entirely be... out of the question...?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What sort of outcome?”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“The outcome of you joining me in holy matrimony!”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Oh, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"That makes sense now.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Still, since when did you become his 'bride?'”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I believe it to be because Himi-no-Mikoto-sama appointed me Mitsurugi-sama's handmaiden and charged me with caring for his body.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“There are occasions where I minister him with magicks all through the night, so it is not surprising that such rumors would arise...”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You know, Chihaya, that title of 'Mitsurugi's bride...'”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Y-Yes?! I very much look forward to our future together!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"What could she possibly have to look forward to?",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...Hearing it put Himi-no-Mikoto into a foul temper just the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“She was saying things like 'That quean of a girl is much too conceited,' or 'I ought to teach her a real lesson...'”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Ee-Eeeeeeeep?!”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Mm... That doesn't sound good.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“At this rate, we just might find your head decorating the palace gates one day.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I'm terribly sorry, I'm terribly sorry! I shall never call myself a bride again! Please, have mercy on me...!”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru, cut it out with the tasteless jokes.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Hweh? Do you mean to say that Himi-no-Mikoto-sama is not truly incensed?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Don't worry. Himi-no-Mikoto wasn't being serious.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“*Sniffle...* Ooh, that is ten years of my life I will never get back...”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Well, Mitsurugi? Got yourself any plans to start a family, or what?”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“With a certain little Chihaya, perhaps?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I-I-I would not have any objections whatsoever, um... if Mitsurugi-sama happened to be so inclined, that is...”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Blushing furiously, Chihaya repeatedly steals glance after glance at mine direction.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...Do you mean to say that you are in love with me, Chihaya?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“You didn't realize it until just now?!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Oh, forget about it... *Sniffle...*”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Chihaya slumps her shoulders with a wearied look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto did tell me of Chihaya's feelings, but I never would have expected them to be true.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"It seems I truly know nothing about affairs of the human heart.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Despite that, however, I can declare with certainty that Chihaya has become a dear and irreplaceable companion of mine.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“All mine heart knows is the loyalty it feels towards Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And so, um, when it comes to starting a family, I'm afraid I\ndon't understand it at all.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“Is that so...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Chihaya limply hangs her head in disappointment, but she quickly raises it soon after.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I see now that you and Himi-no-Mikoto-sama are enjoined by the purest of bonds.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“The two of you are most enviable indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“The bond between lord and servant, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Chihaya nods emphatically.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I could not be prouder to have the privilege of serving them.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Chihaya"},
			{
"“I can think of no greater purpose.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"...One's true purpose, huh?",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Oh, looks like the marriage interviews are over.”",
